<title>USA: Tandy Corp awards 1 mln restricted shares.</title>
<headline>Tandy Corp awards 1 mln restricted shares.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tandy Corp on Monday said it awarded about 1.0 million shares of restricted stock to about 5,000 retail store managers.</p>
<p>The stock will vest in five years, or sooner if it closes at $67.625 or greater for 20 consecutive days after February 1, 1999.</p>
<p>Tandy shares were down 1/8 at 48-7/8 in early afternoon trading. Their 52-week high was 59-1/8.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
